  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is that RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool and PCA is much better than single-profile RNA or transformer aggregation, while ResNet image-only multiprofile avgpool remains weak. The key uncertainty is whether fusing the weak image modality with the strong RNA modality helps at all. config_018 keeps the best RNA setting and the already characterized ResNet image setting fixed, adding only multimodal concat fusion. This is the simplest direct test of whether multimodal fusion can improve on the current best unimodal baseline, making it a high-value use of the next limited experiment."
}

